 "<div style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;font-size:23px;color:#5fbf8f;font-weight:700\">El forastero</div><div style=\"font-style:italic;color:#d8c3a0\">nadie sabe quién es</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\">Óscar Vidal</div>": "<div style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;font-size:23px;color:#5fbf8f;font-weight:700\">Il forestiero</div><div style=\"font-style:italic;color:#d8c3a0\">nessuno sa chi sia</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\">Óscar Vidal</div>",
